r that i  hope we see more of  it actually slipped my mind that gordo  never told tracy the truth about what  happened with danny on his last mission  to the moon he just went to the  therapist  and never let her know about how messed  up he was it makes their separation and  everything that's happened  since hit a little differently when you  think about it  marco getting a little close with sergey  is fun to watch  but it's a little hard to see how that  could end well at best  one of them would have to end up  defecting and they both seem completely  dedicated to their respective  jobs let me know in the comments what  you think about the chances of apollo  soyuz happening  plus whatever else you've got on your  mind because there's a lot to talk about  here  and this video's length is getting away  from me so i think this is the right  place to stop it  and we can pick it back up down below  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already thanks for watching i'll  talk to you soon  you
 

